Conservation check: sum over children of share_i == parent total? share_i = total * t_i / T rounded... each exact, sum = total * sum(t_i)/T = total. Since each division exact and sum t_i = T, sum shares = total * (sum t_i) / T = total. Exact in BigDecimal addition. Good — no separate check needed, but I could assert. Skip.

